@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Web translation: exact reviewed lookup, then optional AI
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Translator\n<<React function>>" as Web
participant "main.translate\n<<route function>>" as API
participant "dataset / grounding\n<<modules>>" as Local
participant "service : GeminiService" as AI
participant "Gemini HTTPS" as Provider

User -> Web : submit()
activate Web
note over Web : Reject blank/listening/pending inputs;\nfreeze direction/options for this request.
Web -> API : POST /api/translate\nTranslationRequest
activate API
API -> Local : get_grounding() via thread pool
activate Local
alt use_dataset = true
  note over Local : Read locked CSV; retrieve approved, labelled\nalignments only; cap evidence and detect ambiguity.
else dataset use disabled
  note over Local : No corpus read; without_dataset(text).
end
Local --> API : entries + Grounding, or storage error
deactivate Local
alt Unambiguous approved full-entry alignment
  API -> Local : local_translation(grounding, language)
  activate Local
  Local --> API : TranslationContent
  deactivate Local
  note over API : origin=dataset; model=local-dataset;\nwording preserved, no tone synthesis.
else No exact answer and allow_ai = true
  API -> AI : await translate(request, evidence, coverage)
  activate AI
  AI -> AI : await _generate(..., structured=True)
  activate AI
  AI -> Provider : generateContent (selected evidence only)
  activate Provider
  Provider --> AI : Response or transport failure
  deactivate Provider
  note over AI : Validate response/finish status; one bounded\n503 retry is expanded in the chat/provider view.
  AI --> AI : JSON text or AIError
  deactivate AI
  AI --> API : Validated TranslationContent or AIError
  deactivate AI
  note over API : Prefix unverified note; origin=ai_with_dataset\nwhen evidence exists, otherwise ai.
else No exact answer and allow_ai = false
  note over API : 422 with actionable alignment/review guidance.
end
opt Translation content obtained
  API -> API : analyze(translation, entries)
  activate API
  note over API : Build reviewed word map; local lexer runs.\nNo corpus mutation or automatic learning.
  API --> API : AnalysisResult
  deactivate API
end
API --> Web : TranslationResponse or safe HTTP error
deactivate API
Web --> User : Origin, evidence, coverage, tokens / error
deactivate Web
legend bottom
  Awaited work is shown as a request/reply interval, not a blocked UI thread.
  Storage/validation/provider failure exits to an error; it never becomes a success.
  Cancellation prevents stale display, not guaranteed server/provider rollback.
endlegend
@enduml
